## Signing material. A committed private key cannot be un-published: rotating the
## certificate is the only fix, and every shipped package has to be re-signed.
## New-SigningCertificate.ps1 writes into artifacts/, which is ignored above too.
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
*.snk
*.cer
*.crt
*.der
*.p7b
*.keystore
*.cred

